The mlibc flavour of the myos targets (`<arch>-unknown-myos-mlibc`) as a
unix target: `target_os = "myos"` added to std's unix code, over the libc
crate's myos module (libc-myos.patch). Applied by wire-myos.py to the
library tree of the pinned nightly, after its own wiring.

Adapted from Managarm's std port, another system on mlibc (patch
0005-library-std-add-managarm-support.patch of
https://github.com/managarm/bootstrap-managarm, patches/rust; by Dennis
Bonke and the Managarm contributors), renamed and rebased onto this
nightly. A patch to the Rust standard library: MIT OR Apache-2.0, as the
library (THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

